{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Where has|strong=\"H5973\"your|strong=\"H1245\"beloved|strong=\"H1730\"gone|strong=\"H1980\", you|strong=\"H5973\"fairest|strong=\"H3303\"among|strong=\"H5973\"women?  \nWhere has|strong=\"H5973\"your|strong=\"H1245\"beloved|strong=\"H1730\"turned|strong=\"H6437\", that|strong=\"H1730\"we|strong=\"H3068\"may seek|strong=\"H1245\"him|strong=\"H5973\"with|strong=\"H5973\"you|strong=\"H5973\"?   \nBeloved  \n"},{"number":2,"text":"My|strong=\"H7462\"beloved|strong=\"H1730\"has|strong=\"H1730\"gone|strong=\"H3381\"down|strong=\"H3381\"to|strong=\"H3381\"his|strong=\"H3381\"garden|strong=\"H1588\",  \nto|strong=\"H3381\"the|strong=\"H3381\"beds|strong=\"H6170\"of|strong=\"H1588\"spices|strong=\"H1314\",  \nto|strong=\"H3381\"pasture|strong=\"H7462\"his|strong=\"H3381\"flock in|strong=\"H7462\"the|strong=\"H3381\"gardens|strong=\"H1588\", and|strong=\"H3381\"to|strong=\"H3381\"gather|strong=\"H3950\"lilies|strong=\"H7799\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"I am my|strong=\"H7462\"beloved|strong=\"H1730\"’s, and|strong=\"H7462\"my|strong=\"H7462\"beloved|strong=\"H1730\"is|strong=\"H1730\"mine.  \nHe browses among|strong=\"H7799\"the|strong=\"H7462\"lilies|strong=\"H7799\".   \nLover  \n"},{"number":4,"text":"You are beautiful|strong=\"H3303\", my love|strong=\"H7474\", as|strong=\"H3389\"Tirzah|strong=\"H8656\",  \nlovely|strong=\"H5000\"as|strong=\"H3389\"Jerusalem|strong=\"H3389\",  \nawesome as|strong=\"H3389\"an army|strong=\"H1713\"with|strong=\"H3389\"banners|strong=\"H1713\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"Turn|strong=\"H5437\"away|strong=\"H5437\"your|strong=\"H4480\"eyes|strong=\"H5869\"from|strong=\"H4480\"me|strong=\"H4480\",  \nfor|strong=\"H5869\"they|strong=\"H1992\"have|strong=\"H5869\"overcome|strong=\"H7292\"me|strong=\"H4480\".  \nYour|strong=\"H4480\"hair|strong=\"H8181\"is|strong=\"H5869\"like|strong=\"H5437\"a|strong=\"H3068\"flock|strong=\"H5739\"of|strong=\"H5869\"goats|strong=\"H5795\",  \nthat|strong=\"H4480\"lie along the|strong=\"H4480\"side|strong=\"H5437\"of|strong=\"H5869\"Gilead|strong=\"H1568\".   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"Your|strong=\"H3605\"teeth|strong=\"H8127\"are|strong=\"H8127\"like|strong=\"H5927\"a|strong=\"H3068\"flock|strong=\"H5739\"of|strong=\"H4480\"ewes|strong=\"H7353\",  \nwhich|strong=\"H3605\"have|strong=\"H3605\"come|strong=\"H5927\"up|strong=\"H5927\"from|strong=\"H4480\"the|strong=\"H3605\"washing|strong=\"H7367\",  \nof|strong=\"H4480\"which|strong=\"H3605\"every|strong=\"H3605\"one|strong=\"H3605\"has|strong=\"H3605\"twins|strong=\"H8382\";  \nnot|strong=\"H5927\"one|strong=\"H3605\"is|strong=\"H3605\"bereaved|strong=\"H7909\"among|strong=\"H4480\"them|strong=\"H5927\".   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"Your|strong=\"H1157\"temples|strong=\"H7541\"are like a|strong=\"H3068\"piece|strong=\"H6400\"of|strong=\"H7416\"a|strong=\"H3068\"pomegranate|strong=\"H7416\"behind|strong=\"H1157\"your|strong=\"H1157\"veil|strong=\"H6777\".   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"There|strong=\"H1992\"are|strong=\"H1992\"sixty|strong=\"H8346\"queens|strong=\"H4436\", eighty|strong=\"H8084\"concubines|strong=\"H6370\",  \nand|strong=\"H8346\"virgins|strong=\"H5959\"without|strong=\"H5959\"number|strong=\"H4557\".   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"My|strong=\"H7200\"dove|strong=\"H3123\", my|strong=\"H7200\"perfect|strong=\"H8535\"one|strong=\"H1931\", is|strong=\"H1931\"unique.  \nShe|strong=\"H1931\"is|strong=\"H1931\"her|strong=\"H7200\"mother’s only daughter|strong=\"H1323\".  \nShe|strong=\"H1931\"is|strong=\"H1931\"the|strong=\"H7200\"favorite one|strong=\"H1931\"of|strong=\"H1323\"her|strong=\"H7200\"who|strong=\"H1931\"bore|strong=\"H3205\"her|strong=\"H7200\".  \nThe|strong=\"H7200\"daughters|strong=\"H1323\"saw|strong=\"H7200\"her|strong=\"H7200\", and|strong=\"H7200\"called her|strong=\"H7200\"blessed.  \nThe|strong=\"H7200\"queens|strong=\"H4436\"and|strong=\"H7200\"the|strong=\"H7200\"concubines|strong=\"H6370\"saw|strong=\"H7200\"her|strong=\"H7200\", and|strong=\"H7200\"they|strong=\"H1931\"praised|strong=\"H1984\"her|strong=\"H7200\".   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"Who|strong=\"H4310\"is|strong=\"H4310\"she|strong=\"H2063\"who|strong=\"H4310\"looks|strong=\"H8259\"out|strong=\"H8259\"as|strong=\"H3644\"the|strong=\"H3644\"morning|strong=\"H7837\",  \nbeautiful|strong=\"H3303\"as|strong=\"H3644\"the|strong=\"H3644\"moon|strong=\"H3842\",  \nclear|strong=\"H1249\"as|strong=\"H3644\"the|strong=\"H3644\"sun|strong=\"H2535\",  \nand|strong=\"H3303\"awesome as|strong=\"H3644\"an|strong=\"H3644\"army|strong=\"H1713\"with|strong=\"H1713\"banners|strong=\"H1713\"?   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"I|strong=\"H7200\"went|strong=\"H3381\"down|strong=\"H3381\"into|strong=\"H3381\"the|strong=\"H7200\"nut tree|strong=\"H7416\"grove,  \nto|strong=\"H3381\"see|strong=\"H7200\"the|strong=\"H7200\"green plants of|strong=\"H5158\"the|strong=\"H7200\"valley|strong=\"H5158\",  \nto|strong=\"H3381\"see|strong=\"H7200\"whether|strong=\"H7200\"the|strong=\"H7200\"vine|strong=\"H1612\"budded|strong=\"H6524\",  \nand|strong=\"H7200\"the|strong=\"H7200\"pomegranates|strong=\"H7416\"were|strong=\"H7200\"in|strong=\"H7200\"flower.   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"Without|strong=\"H3808\"realizing it|strong=\"H7760\",  \nmy|strong=\"H7760\"desire|strong=\"H5315\"set|strong=\"H7760\"me|strong=\"H5315\"with|strong=\"H3045\"my|strong=\"H7760\"royal people|strong=\"H5971\"’s chariots|strong=\"H4818\".   \nFriends  \n"},{"number":13,"text":"Return, return, Shulammite!  \nReturn, return, that we|strong=\"H3068\"may gaze at you.  \nLover  \nWhy do you desire to gaze at the Shulammite,  \nas at the dance of Mahanaim?   \n"}]}
